WEBVTT

00:09.143 --> 00:10.411
ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.444 --> 00:12.446
Kids:
AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
孩子们：
是的，是的，队长！

00:12.480 --> 00:13.814
I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
我听不到你说话。

00:13.847 --> 00:15.516
( louder ):
AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
（大声）：
是的，是的，队长！

00:15.549 --> 00:18.719
* OH...
* 哦...

00:18.752 --> 00:20.788
* WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:20.821 --> 00:22.790
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:22.823 --> 00:25.293
* ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE. *
* 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的。 *

00:25.326 --> 00:26.694
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:26.727 --> 00:29.097
* IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE BE
SOMETHING YOU WISH... *
*如果航海废话是
您想要的东西... *

00:29.130 --> 00:30.364
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:30.398 --> 00:33.134
* THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH. *
* 然后掉到甲板上
像鱼一样扑通扑通。 *

00:33.167 --> 00:34.768
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:34.802 --> 00:36.704
* READY?
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 准备好？
海绵宝宝！ *

00:36.737 --> 00:39.707
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:39.740 --> 00:40.741
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:40.774 --> 00:43.377
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:43.411 --> 00:45.713
( laughs heartily )
（会心地笑）

00:45.746 --> 00:49.217
[Captioning sponsored by THE
U.S. DEPARTMENT OF EDUCATION
( plays airy tune )
[字幕由THE赞助
美国教育部
（演奏轻快的曲调）

00:49.250 --> 00:50.718
and NICKELODEON]
和尼克频道]

01:02.496 --> 01:08.736
( growling and grunting )
（咆哮和咕哝）

01:11.905 --> 01:15.576
IT'S TIME TO GROW MYSELF
LARGE AND WIDE.
是时候让自己成长了
大而宽。

01:18.579 --> 01:22.416
( struggling )
（挣扎）

01:22.450 --> 01:26.654
( grunting slowly builds up )
（咕哝声慢慢增强）

01:26.687 --> 01:28.289
( groaning frenziedly )
（疯狂地呻吟）

01:28.322 --> 01:29.857
( yells )
（大喊）

01:31.292 --> 01:33.161
( doorbell rings )
（门铃响了）

01:36.264 --> 01:37.265
HOWDY, SPONGEBOB.
你好，海绵宝宝。

01:37.298 --> 01:38.399
HOW'S IT GOING?
怎么样了？

01:38.432 --> 01:39.667
NOT TOO CLOSE, SANDY.
不太近，桑迪。

01:39.700 --> 01:42.403
I TEND TO GET SMELLY
WHEN I'M PUMPING IRON.
我容易发臭
当我打铁的时候。

01:42.436 --> 01:43.871
CHECK IT OUT.
一探究竟。

01:43.904 --> 01:45.539
WELL, YOU'RE SMELLY.
嗯，你身上有臭味。

01:45.573 --> 01:48.442
ALL THANKS TO MY
STATE-OF-THE-ART WEIGHT SET.
全部感谢我的
最先进的配重装置。

01:50.544 --> 01:53.314
UH... I DON'T WANT
TO DISAPPOINT YOU,
SPONGEBOB
呃...我不想
让你失望的是，
海绵宝宝

01:53.347 --> 01:55.449
BUT YOU WON'T SEE
PROGRESS LIFTING THOSE.
但你不会看到
提升这些进展。

01:55.483 --> 01:56.350
OH, REALLY?
哦真的吗？

01:56.384 --> 01:59.920
THAT IS, IF YOU WANT ARMS
LIKE THESE.
也就是说，如果你想要武器
像这些。

01:59.953 --> 02:00.588
HUH?
嗯？

02:00.621 --> 02:02.390
OR THESE.
或者这些。

02:03.391 --> 02:04.858
OR THESE!
或者这些！

02:07.795 --> 02:10.731
WELL, MAYBE I COULD USE
A LITTLE HELP.
好吧，也许我可以用
一点帮助。

02:10.764 --> 02:12.500
WELL, IF YOU WANT ARMS LIKE MINE
好吧，如果你想要像我一样的手臂

02:12.533 --> 02:14.668
YOU JUST GOT TO FOLLOW
MY TRAINING PROGRAM.
你只需跟随
我的训练计划。

02:14.702 --> 02:16.470
WOW! REALLY?
哇！真的吗？

02:16.504 --> 02:18.339
THAT'D BE GREAT, SANDY.
那太好了，桑迪。

02:18.372 --> 02:19.673
I CAN SEE ME NOW.
我现在可以看到我了。

02:22.776 --> 02:25.813
( humming light tune,
feet landing with thuds )
（哼着轻快的曲子，
脚落地时发出重击声）

02:25.846 --> 02:27.448
GOOD NIGHT, GARY.
晚安，加里。

02:27.481 --> 02:29.283
( meows )
（喵）

02:29.317 --> 02:33.521
YEAH, THAT WOULD
CHANGE EVERYTHING.
是的，那会
改变一切。

02:33.554 --> 02:35.356
BE AT MY PLACE
AT 5:00 A.M.
待在我身边
凌晨 5:00

02:35.389 --> 02:38.226
OH, AND YOU'LL NEED
A WATER HELMET.
哦，你需要
水头盔。

02:38.259 --> 02:40.328
( SpongeBob grunting )
（海绵宝宝咕哝）

02:40.361 --> 02:42.463
COME ON, SPONGEBOB.
来吧，海绵宝宝。

02:42.496 --> 02:44.532
IT'S ONLY PUSHUPS.
这只是俯卧撑。

02:44.565 --> 02:46.567
COME ON, COME ON,
YOU CAN DO IT.
来吧，来吧，
你可以做到。

02:46.600 --> 02:48.902
( grunting )
（咕哝）

02:48.936 --> 02:51.439
( groaning frenziedly )
（疯狂地呻吟）

02:51.472 --> 02:52.506
( pop )
（ 流行音乐 ）

02:52.540 --> 02:53.907
ONE.
一。

02:53.941 --> 02:55.576
( dings )
（叮当声）

02:55.609 --> 02:56.944
ALL RIGHT, PUT THEM UP.
好吧，把它们放起来。

02:56.977 --> 03:00.981
( groaning )
（呻吟）

03:01.014 --> 03:01.982
THEY'RE UP.
他们起来了。

03:02.015 --> 03:02.883
DING, DING.
丁，丁。

03:06.687 --> 03:10.758
( panting )
（气喘吁吁）

03:10.791 --> 03:14.428
( panting quickens )
（气喘吁吁）

03:14.462 --> 03:15.563
( richocheting boings )
（丰富的轰鸣声）

03:15.596 --> 03:17.465
FEELING THE BURN?
感到灼烧感吗？

03:17.498 --> 03:18.966
I'M FEELING SOMETHING!
我有感觉！

03:18.999 --> 03:20.868
( screams )
（尖叫声）

03:20.901 --> 03:22.836
( smack )
（咂嘴）

03:22.870 --> 03:24.938
( squeaking )
（吱吱声）

03:26.974 --> 03:29.610
WELL, NOW THAT
WE'VE GOT YOU WARMED UP
好吧，现在
我们已为您热身

03:29.643 --> 03:32.513
IT'S TIME FOR THE ARM CRUNCHER.
是时候使用手臂粉碎机了。

03:32.546 --> 03:34.615
ARM CRUNCHER, GREAT.
手臂粉碎机，太棒了。

03:34.648 --> 03:37.385
( loud slamming )
（大声撞击）

03:37.418 --> 03:39.253
THIS SQUIRREL'S TRYING
TO KILL ME.
这只松鼠正在尝试
杀了我。

03:39.287 --> 03:40.554
THIS IS IT.
就是这样。

03:40.588 --> 03:42.490
SpongeBob ( on phone ):
That's great!
海绵宝宝（电话中）：
太好了！

03:42.523 --> 03:44.625
We'll have to do it
again sometime-- bye.
我们必须这么做
下次再来——再见。

03:44.658 --> 03:45.559
( dial tone hums )
（拨号音嗡嗡声）

03:45.593 --> 03:47.761
THIS WORKING OUT THING
ISN'T WORKING OUT.
这个锻炼的事情
不锻炼。

03:47.795 --> 03:49.029
( heartbeat throbbing )
（心跳剧烈）

03:49.062 --> 03:50.364
OW!
噢！

03:50.398 --> 03:51.399
OW!
噢！

03:51.432 --> 03:52.300
OW!
噢！

03:52.333 --> 03:54.635
( gruffly, on TV ):
Hey! Hey, you!
（粗声粗气，在电视上）：
嘿！嘿，你！

03:54.668 --> 03:56.437
Wimpy, wimpy,
wimpy.
懦弱，懦弱，
懦弱的。

03:56.470 --> 03:58.439
"Ooh, I'm a little
peanut worm."
“哦哦，我有点
花生虫。”

03:58.472 --> 04:00.774
Are you too much of
a wimp to work out?
你是不是太过分了
一个懦夫去锻炼？

04:00.808 --> 04:04.745
Are you a weakling
built like a sponge?
你是弱者吗
像海绵一样建造？

04:04.778 --> 04:07.014
Well, now, you, too,
can have muscles.
好吧，现在你也一样，
可以有肌肉。

04:07.047 --> 04:07.915
HUH?
嗯？

04:07.948 --> 04:09.783
WITH ANCHOR ARMS!
带锚臂！

04:09.817 --> 04:11.585
THEY SLIP ON LIKE A GLOVE.
它们像手套一样方便穿脱。

04:11.619 --> 04:12.720
JUST ADD AIR.
只需添加空气即可。

04:12.753 --> 04:14.355
( air hisses )
（空气嘶嘶声）

04:14.388 --> 04:16.457
HOW BIG DO YOU WANT THEM?
您想要多大？

04:16.490 --> 04:18.892
NORMAL? VEINY?
普通的？静脉？

04:18.926 --> 04:22.630
AND FOR THE LADIES... HAIRY.
对于女士们来说……毛茸茸的。

04:22.663 --> 04:23.431
( whistles )
（口哨声）

04:23.464 --> 04:25.699
I WAS A WIMP
BEFORE ANCHOR ARMS.
我是个懦夫
在锚臂之前。

04:25.733 --> 04:29.337
NOW I'M A JERK,
AND EVERYBODY LOVES ME.
现在我是个混蛋，
每个人都爱我。

04:29.370 --> 04:31.572
SO ORDER NOW, WIMP!
所以现在就订购吧，弱者！

04:31.605 --> 04:33.574
WOW... NOW, THAT'S A GOOD IDEA.
哇...现在，这是个好主意。

04:33.607 --> 04:34.808
( meows )
（喵）

04:34.842 --> 04:36.810
I WANT TO BE JUST LIKE HIM.
我想成为像他一样的人。

04:36.844 --> 04:39.447
YEAH, I'VE GOT TO GET
TO A PHONE.
是的，我必须得到
到电话。

04:39.480 --> 04:41.615
( slurping )
（吸食）

04:43.551 --> 04:44.985
SpongeBob:
HI, SQUIDWARD.
海绵宝宝：
嗨，章鱼哥。

04:45.018 --> 04:46.587
( muffled ):
SPONGEBOB?
（低声）：
海绵宝宝？

04:46.620 --> 04:47.588
( humming )
（嗡嗡声）

04:47.621 --> 04:49.423
( gasps )
（喘气）

04:49.457 --> 04:50.691
AHOY, MR. KRABS.
哎哟，先生。螃蟹。

04:50.724 --> 04:51.992
MOTHER-OF-PEARL!
珍珠母贝！

04:54.528 --> 05:00.067
( all grunting )
（全都咕哝着）

05:03.136 --> 05:05.072
( all gasp )
（全都喘气）

05:06.474 --> 05:06.907
OW.
OW.
哦。
哦。

05:08.642 --> 05:09.643
HI, GUYS.
嗨，大家好。

05:09.677 --> 05:12.913
SPONGEBOB, IS THAT YOU?
海绵宝宝，是你吗？

05:15.082 --> 05:16.784
WHO ARE YOU
EXPECTING?
你是谁
期待吗？

05:16.817 --> 05:18.586
TINY TIM?
小蒂姆？

05:18.619 --> 05:20.020
WAIT, WAIT...
等等，等等...

05:20.053 --> 05:21.655
BIG, AREN'T THEY?
很大，不是吗？

05:21.689 --> 05:23.557
DUDE, YOU'RE RIPPED.
老兄，你被撕裂了。

05:25.025 --> 05:27.395
THANK... YOU.
谢谢。

05:28.729 --> 05:29.963
I'VE BEEN WORKING OUT.
我一直在锻炼。

05:31.565 --> 05:33.401
EXCUSE ME A SECOND.
请原谅我一下。

05:33.434 --> 05:35.903
YEAH.
是的。

05:35.936 --> 05:39.106
ANYONE FOR THE JUICE BAR?
有人喜欢果汁吧吗？

05:40.741 --> 05:42.443
I'M TELLING YOU,
HE'S HUGE!
我告诉你，
他很大！

05:42.476 --> 05:44.645
HAVE YOU GUYS SEEN
SPONGEBOB ANYWHERE?
你们看过吗
海绵宝宝在哪里？

05:44.678 --> 05:46.514
YOU MEAN MUSCLEBOB BUFFPANTS?
您是说肌肉波波布迷彩裤吗？

05:46.547 --> 05:47.715
HE'S IN THERE.
他就在那里。

05:47.748 --> 05:49.082
UH... WHATEVER.
呃……不管怎样。

05:49.116 --> 05:50.851
THANKS.
谢谢。

05:50.884 --> 05:53.687
SpongeBob:
I START OFF
WITH 20 RAW EGGS EVERY DAY
海绵宝宝：
我开始
每天 20 个生鸡蛋

05:53.721 --> 05:55.523
BUT THAT'S JUST ME.
但这只是我。

05:55.556 --> 05:56.790
WORKING OUT IS MY LIFE.
锻炼就是我的生活。

05:56.824 --> 05:58.859
I REMEMBER WHEN
I USED TO LOOK
我记得当
我以前看过

05:58.892 --> 06:00.494
LIKE THAT GUY OVER THERE.
就像那边那个人。

06:00.528 --> 06:02.696
WHO, ME?
谁，我？

06:02.730 --> 06:04.164
( others laugh )
（其他人笑）

06:04.197 --> 06:07.067
I REMEMBER WHEN I USED
TO LOOK LIKE YOU, TOO.
我记得当我使用时
也想看起来像你。

06:07.100 --> 06:08.602
( all laugh harder )
（大家笑得更厉害了）

06:08.636 --> 06:10.003
BUT THAT WAS A LONG TIME AGO.
但那是很久以前的事了。

06:10.037 --> 06:11.472
HERE'S YOUR DRINK, SIR.
先生，这是您的饮料。

06:11.505 --> 06:12.506
THANK YOU.
谢谢。

06:12.540 --> 06:15.843
( grunting )
（咕哝）

06:15.876 --> 06:17.745
OOP.
面向对象编程。

06:17.778 --> 06:19.112
( grunting )
（咕哝）

06:19.146 --> 06:21.615
( rattling )
（嘎嘎作响）

06:21.649 --> 06:22.550
( grunting )
（咕哝）

06:28.756 --> 06:30.458
( slurps )
（啜饮）

06:30.491 --> 06:31.625
YEAH.
是的。

06:31.659 --> 06:33.827
Sandy:
SPONGEBOB?
桑迪：
海绵宝宝？

06:33.861 --> 06:36.129
WHERE'D YOU GET THOSE MUSCLES?
你从哪里得到这些肌肉？

06:36.163 --> 06:38.131
I'VE CREATED
MY OWN WORKOUT ROUTINE
我已经创造了
我自己的锻炼程序

06:38.165 --> 06:40.634
THAT'S GIVING ME
AMAZING RESULTS-- OOPS.
这给了我
惊人的结果——哎呀。

06:40.668 --> 06:42.470
YEAH, I HAVE NEVER FELT BETTER.
是的，我从来没有感觉好过。

06:42.503 --> 06:43.671
HECK, WHAT'S YOUR SECRET?
哎呀，你的秘密是什么？

06:43.704 --> 06:44.872
WHAT?
什么？

06:44.905 --> 06:46.974
YOUR SECRET WORKOUT--
WHAT IS IT?
你的秘密锻炼——
它是什么？

06:47.007 --> 06:48.742
( all inquire at once )
（全部立即询问）

06:48.776 --> 06:50.978
HMM-- WELL, I, UH...
嗯——嗯，我，呃……

06:51.011 --> 06:53.547
FIRST I...
首先我...

06:53.581 --> 06:56.149
TAKE MY HAND AND I DO THIS.
握住我的手，我就这么做。

06:56.183 --> 06:58.586
( makes farting noise )
（发出放屁声）

06:58.619 --> 07:00.588
ARE YOU KIDDING?
你在开玩笑吧？

07:00.621 --> 07:02.523
DO THESE MUSCLES LIE?
这些肌肉会说谎吗？

07:06.093 --> 07:07.895
( all repeat imitation farting )
（全部重复模仿放屁）

07:07.928 --> 07:09.563
I'M GLAD TO SEE
YOU'VE FOUND
I'M GLAD TO SEE
你已经找到了

07:09.597 --> 07:11.565
AN EXERCISE PROGRAM
THAT WORKS FOR YOU.
锻炼计划
这对你有用。

07:11.599 --> 07:12.733
YEAH, YOUR
WORKOUT ROUTINE
是的，你的
锻炼程序

07:12.766 --> 07:14.635
WASN'T QUITE TOUGH
ENOUGH FOR ME.
不是很艰难
对我来说足够了。

07:14.668 --> 07:16.069
CAN'T ARGUE
WITH THOSE RESULTS.
不能争论
有了这些结果。

07:16.103 --> 07:19.139
WHAT YOU NEED TO DO NOW IS
PUT THOSE MUSCLES TO THE TEST.
您现在需要做的是
测试这些肌肉。

07:19.172 --> 07:20.574
UH... WHAT DO YOU MEAN?
呃……你什么意思？

07:20.608 --> 07:22.743
THE MUSSEL BEACH
ANCHOR TOSS
COMPETITION.
贻贝海滩
抛锚
竞争。

07:22.776 --> 07:24.578
IT'S TODAY.
就在今天。

07:24.612 --> 07:25.979
HERE'S YOUR DRINK.
这是你的饮料。

07:26.013 --> 07:27.180
( air deflating )
（放气）

07:27.214 --> 07:29.750
HEY, WITH THOSE ARMS,
YOU'LL DO GREAT.
嘿，有了这些手臂，
你会做得很好。

07:29.783 --> 07:31.685
WELL, I'M NOT SURE.
嗯，我不确定。

07:31.719 --> 07:33.721
COME ON, LET'S GO.
来吧，我们走吧。

07:33.754 --> 07:34.788
RIGHT NOW?
现在？

07:34.822 --> 07:35.889
WAIT, WAIT, SANDY!
等等，等等，桑迪！

07:35.923 --> 07:37.625
I DON'T THINK IT'S SUCH A...
我不认为这是这样的...

07:38.926 --> 07:40.594
SANDY, WAIT!
桑迪，等等！

07:40.628 --> 07:41.929
( groaning )
（呻吟）

07:41.962 --> 07:44.565
HERE IT IS-- THE SIGN-IN LIST.
这是登录列表。

07:44.598 --> 07:45.666
OH, NO.
哦，不。

07:45.699 --> 07:47.535
OKAY.
好的。

07:47.568 --> 07:48.802
SANDY...
沙...

07:48.836 --> 07:50.971
( grunting )
（咕哝）

07:51.004 --> 07:52.840
CHEEKS.
脸颊。

07:52.873 --> 07:54.575
( groaning )
（呻吟）

07:54.608 --> 07:57.077
WAIT, SANDY--
DON'T SIGN JUST YET.
等等，桑迪——
暂时不要签字。

08:00.280 --> 08:01.815
( frenzied struggling )
（疯狂的挣扎）

08:01.849 --> 08:02.983
OKAY...
好的...

08:03.016 --> 08:04.952
WAIT!
等待！

08:04.985 --> 08:09.089
SPONGEBOB... SQUAREPANTS.
海绵宝宝...方裤。

08:09.122 --> 08:10.924
( yelling wildly )
（疯狂地喊叫）

08:10.958 --> 08:12.560
( snaps )
（快照）

08:12.593 --> 08:14.995
SpongeBob:
OH, SANDY.
海绵宝宝：
哦，桑迪。

08:15.028 --> 08:16.630
WAIT!
等待！

08:16.664 --> 08:17.698
IT'S OKAY, SPONGEBOB.
没关系，海绵宝宝。

08:17.731 --> 08:19.700
I ALREADY SIGNED
YOUR NAME IN.
我已经签了
你的名字在。

08:19.733 --> 08:20.668
OH, GREAT.
哦，太棒了。

08:20.701 --> 08:21.669
THANKS, SANDY.
谢谢，桑迪。

08:21.702 --> 08:24.004
Announcer ( over p.a. ):
ARE WE ON?
播音员（全年）：
我们在吗？

08:24.037 --> 08:25.573
WELCOME TO THE GOO LAGOON
欢迎来到粘泻湖

08:25.606 --> 08:27.808
EIGHTH ANNUAL
ANCHOR TOSS COMPETITION.
第八届年度
抛锚比赛。

08:27.841 --> 08:32.145
( all grunting )
（全都咕哝着）

08:33.947 --> 08:35.883
( knees knocking )
（膝盖敲响）

08:35.916 --> 08:38.085
READY, SPONGEBOB?
准备好了吗，海绵宝宝？

08:38.118 --> 08:40.220
OH, YEAH, SURE, NO PROBLEM.
哦，是的，当然，没问题。

08:42.022 --> 08:45.926
( blows frantically )
（疯狂地吹）

08:45.959 --> 08:47.160
CAN I GET SOME MUSTARD ON THAT?
我可以加点芥末吗？

08:47.194 --> 08:49.963
OH-- FIRST UP, DOM THE WHALE.
哦——首先是鲸鱼 DOM。

08:49.997 --> 08:54.101
( all cheering )
（大家欢呼）

08:57.004 --> 08:58.706
200 YARDS!
200 码！

08:58.739 --> 09:01.809
Announcer:
WOW! LET'S SEE
AN INSTANT REPLAY.
播音员：
哇！让我们看看
即时重播。

09:01.842 --> 09:03.176
AMAZING!
惊人的！

09:03.210 --> 09:05.979
UP NEXT, LARRY THE LOBSTER.
接下来是龙虾拉里。

09:06.013 --> 09:06.980
( yells )
（大喊）

09:07.014 --> 09:09.683
( screaming )
（尖叫）

09:09.717 --> 09:11.919
( panting )
（气喘吁吁）

09:13.854 --> 09:15.989
210 YARDS!
210 码！

09:16.023 --> 09:18.726
Announcer:
HERE GOES SANDY CHEEKS.
播音员：
这是沙质脸颊。

09:18.759 --> 09:20.127
WHOA...
哇...

09:20.160 --> 09:21.194
YEE-AHH!
耶-啊！

09:21.228 --> 09:29.937
( fearful squealing )
（可怕的尖叫声）

09:29.970 --> 09:31.639
( thud )
（砰）

09:31.672 --> 09:34.842
510 YARDS!
510 码！

09:34.875 --> 09:36.243
Announcer:
WOW! FABULOUS.
播音员：
哇！太棒了。

09:36.276 --> 09:37.711
BEAT THAT,
SPONGEBOB.
击败那个，
海绵宝宝。

09:37.745 --> 09:40.948
UP NEXT, SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS.
接下来是海绵宝宝。

09:40.981 --> 09:46.086
All ( making farting
noises and chanting ):
SPONGEBOB! SPONGEBOB!
全部（放屁
噪音和口号）：
海绵宝宝！海绵宝宝！

09:46.119 --> 09:51.859
( struggling, grunting )
（挣扎，咕哝）

09:51.892 --> 09:53.326
OUCH.
哎哟。

09:53.360 --> 09:57.631
( audience booing, whistling )
（观众起哄、吹口哨）

09:57.665 --> 10:00.200
UH... JUST KIDDING.
呃……开玩笑的。

10:00.233 --> 10:03.136
( laughter and cheering )
（笑声和欢呼声）

10:03.170 --> 10:06.006
THAT SPONGEBOB'S FUNNIER
THAN EARS ON AN ACORN.
那个海绵宝宝更有趣
比橡子上的耳朵还要多。

10:08.709 --> 10:09.643
OH, THIS IS IT.
哦，就是这样。

10:09.677 --> 10:12.045
THEY'RE ALL GOING TO FIND OUT
I'M A FAKE.
他们都会找到答案
我是假的。

10:12.079 --> 10:13.246
I CAN'T GIVE UP.
我不能放弃。

10:13.280 --> 10:14.648
I'VE GOT TO TRY.
我必须尝试一下。

10:14.682 --> 10:15.883
I CAN DO IT!
我能做到！

10:15.916 --> 10:17.417
I'VE GOT ANCHOR ARMS.
我有锚臂。

10:17.450 --> 10:19.086
I'M NO WIMP.
我不是懦夫。

10:19.119 --> 10:21.021
I'M A JERK!
我是个混蛋！

10:21.054 --> 10:23.390
( blows )
（吹）

10:27.294 --> 10:28.261
YEAH.
是的。

10:31.098 --> 10:35.435
( heavy groaning )
（重重的呻吟声）

10:35.468 --> 10:37.137
( air hisses )
（空气嘶嘶声）

10:37.170 --> 10:39.006
( crowd boos; air hisses )
（人群嘘声；空气嘶嘶声）

10:40.073 --> 10:41.842
( air hisses )
（空气嘶嘶声）

10:41.875 --> 10:43.643
All:
OOH.
全部：
哦。

10:45.045 --> 10:46.146
( air hisses )
（空气嘶嘶声）

10:47.147 --> 10:48.115
( air hisses )
（空气嘶嘶声）

10:48.148 --> 10:51.451
( boinging )
（轰隆声）

10:51.484 --> 10:53.386
All ( chanting ):
SPONGEBOB! SPONGEBOB!
全体（诵经）：
海绵宝宝！海绵宝宝！

10:57.891 --> 11:00.260
( screams )
（尖叫声）

11:00.293 --> 11:02.362
( explosion )
（爆炸）

11:02.395 --> 11:08.802
( air whistles as arms deflate )
（手臂收缩时发出呼啸声）

11:10.470 --> 11:12.773
OOH.
哦。

11:12.806 --> 11:14.441
I THINK HE LOST.
我认为他输了。

11:14.474 --> 11:16.844
All ( chanting ):
SANDY! SANDY! SANDY!
全体（诵经）：
桑迪！沙！沙！

11:20.748 --> 11:22.449
( chuckles weakly )
（弱弱地笑）

11:30.157 --> 11:35.863
SpongeBob:
96... 97... 98...
海绵宝宝：
96...97...98...

11:35.896 --> 11:38.098
99... 100.
99...100。
99...100。
99...100。
99...100。
99...100。
99...100。
99...100。
99...100。
99...100。
99...100。
99...100。
99...100。
99...100。
99...100。
99...100。
99...100。
