12:46.599 --> 12:47.935
KING ME, KING ME!
王我，王我！

12:50.003 --> 12:51.371
I LOSE!
我输了！

12:51.404 --> 12:53.273
BUT IT'S NOT TUESDAY, PATRICK.
但这不是星期二，帕特里克。

12:53.306 --> 12:54.474
TARTAR SAUCE!
鞑靼酱！

12:54.507 --> 12:55.843
Squidward:
HEY!
章鱼哥：
嘿！

12:55.876 --> 12:57.811
WHAT ARE YOU
INVERTEBRATES DOING?
你是什么？
无脊椎动物在做什么？

12:59.179 --> 13:00.948
WE DON'T KNOW.
WE DON'T KNOW.
我们不知道。
我们不知道。

13:00.981 --> 13:04.251
HEY, PATRICK, DO YOU
KNOW WHAT TIME IT IS?
嘿，帕特里克，你呢
知道现在几点了吗？

13:04.284 --> 13:05.819
UH, YEAH, SQUIDWARD.
呃，是的，章鱼哥。

13:05.853 --> 13:06.619
IT'S...
它是...

13:08.221 --> 13:10.490
TIME TO FIND
SOME OTHER GAME TO PLAY.
寻找时间
玩其他游戏。

13:10.523 --> 13:13.293
( laughing )
（笑）

13:13.326 --> 13:17.064
( humming happily )
（高兴地哼哼）

13:17.097 --> 13:18.365
( old-time music playing )
（播放着怀旧音乐）

13:18.398 --> 13:19.432
AH!
啊！

13:21.001 --> 13:22.369
NOW WHAT?
现在怎么办？

13:22.402 --> 13:25.238
WE COULD TOSS THAT
SHELL BACK AND FORTH.
我们可以把它扔掉
来回弹壳。

13:25.272 --> 13:27.040
OKAY!
好的！

13:27.074 --> 13:28.876
READY!
准备好！

13:28.909 --> 13:30.010
GO!
去！

13:30.043 --> 13:31.845
I GOT IT, I GOT IT.
我明白了，我明白了。

13:31.879 --> 13:34.381
I GOT IT,
I GOT IT, I GOT IT!
我明白了，
我明白了，我明白了！

13:34.414 --> 13:35.916
( statue thumps on floor )
（雕像重击地板）

13:35.949 --> 13:36.917
HUH?
嗯？

13:36.950 --> 13:38.318
( mumbles )
（咕哝）

13:39.586 --> 13:42.089
REMEMBER, PATRICK,
FINDERS KEEPERS.
请记住，帕特里克，
发现者、守门员。

13:42.122 --> 13:43.891
THERE IT IS!
就在那里！

13:43.924 --> 13:46.359
I GOT IT! I GOT IT!
I GOT IT! I GOT IT!
我得到了它！我得到了它！
我得到了它！我得到了它！

13:46.393 --> 13:48.061
BONUS POINTS.
奖励积分。

13:48.095 --> 13:49.296
UH, PATRICK?
呃，帕特里克？

13:49.329 --> 13:51.498
I THINK SOMETHING'S WRONG
WITH SQUIDWARD.
我觉得有些不对劲
和章鱼哥一起。

13:51.531 --> 13:53.633
HE LOOKS UNCONSCIOUS.
他看起来失去知觉。

13:53.666 --> 13:54.968
DON'T WORRY.
不用担心。

13:55.002 --> 13:56.303
I KNOW
HOW TO DO THIS.
我知道
如何做到这一点。

13:56.336 --> 13:59.006
( inhaling deeply )
（深吸一口气）

13:59.039 --> 14:01.141
( breath squeaking out )
（喘气声）

14:03.310 --> 14:04.444
( inhaling again )
（再次吸气）

14:10.918 --> 14:13.486
( buzzing like
deflating balloon )
（嗡嗡声像
气球放气）

14:13.520 --> 14:14.654
GET OFF HIM,
PATRICK!
摆脱他，
帕特里克！

14:14.687 --> 14:16.656
WHAT ARE YOU
WORRIED ABOUT?
你是什么？
担心吗？

14:16.689 --> 14:19.059
HE LOOKS BETTER ALREADY.
他看起来已经好多了。

14:19.092 --> 14:20.160
BUT HE STILL
FEELS COLD.
但他仍然
感觉很冷。

14:20.193 --> 14:22.195
WELL, LET'S GO
PUT HIM IN THE WARM.
好吧，我们走吧
让他感到温暖。

14:22.229 --> 14:23.964
DO YOU THINK
HE'LL BE OKAY?
你认为
他会没事的吗？

14:23.997 --> 14:26.166
YOU KNOW, YOU WORRY TOO MUCH.
你知道，你担心太多了。

14:26.199 --> 14:28.335
THE PATRICK IS HERE
帕特里克在这里

14:28.368 --> 14:31.571
AND SPONGEBOB,
I KNOW A LOT
还有海绵宝宝，
我知道很多

14:31.604 --> 14:35.375
ABOUT HEAD INJURIES,
BELIEVE...
关于头部受伤，
相信...

14:35.408 --> 14:36.944
( snaps fingers )
（打响指）

14:36.977 --> 14:38.011
ME.
我。

14:38.045 --> 14:39.913
HEY, WHAT'S THAT
ON YOUR SHOE?
嘿，那是什么
在你的鞋子上吗？

14:39.947 --> 14:41.014
I DON'T KNOW.
我不知道。

14:41.048 --> 14:43.016
IT KIND OF
LOOKS LIKE...
有点像
看起来像……

14:43.050 --> 14:44.151
SQUIDWARD!
SQUIDWARD!
章鱼哥！
章鱼哥！

14:44.184 --> 14:45.452
( both yelling )
（两人都大喊大叫）

14:45.485 --> 14:47.320
SpongeBob:
GET HIM OFF ME!
海绵宝宝：
把他从我身上拿开！

14:47.354 --> 14:49.189
GO AWAY, GO AWAY!
走开，走开！

14:49.222 --> 14:51.959
( humming contentedly
as music continues playing )
（满足地哼哼
随着音乐继续播放）

14:58.465 --> 15:00.500
NO, NO,
THAT PART GOES HERE.
不，不，
该部分放在这里。

15:00.533 --> 15:03.270
OH, YEAH... YEAH,
TH-THAT'S IT, UH-HUH.
哦，是的...是的，
就是这样，嗯哼。

15:03.303 --> 15:04.137
WE'RE ALMOST THERE.
我们快到了。

15:04.171 --> 15:05.138
WE CAN DO THIS.
我们可以做到。

15:05.172 --> 15:06.639
IT'S WORKING,
IT'S WORKING.
它正在发挥作用，
它正在发挥作用。

15:06.673 --> 15:07.640
THIS IS WORKING.
这是有效的。

15:09.342 --> 15:10.710
PATRICK, THIS ISN'T WORKING!
帕特里克，这行不通！

15:10.743 --> 15:11.578
LOOK!
看！

15:13.713 --> 15:15.382
I DON'T KNOW
HOW TO SAY IT
我不知道
怎么说

15:15.415 --> 15:17.650
BUT OUR OLD PAL
SQUIDWARD, HE'S... HE'S...
但是我们的老朋友
章鱼哥，他是……他是……

15:17.684 --> 15:19.219
HE'S PUSHING UP DAISIES.
他正在推雏菊。

15:19.252 --> 15:21.121
OH, I THOUGHT
HE WAS DEAD.
哦，我以为
他死了。

15:21.154 --> 15:21.955
( door squeaks )
（门吱吱作响）

15:24.757 --> 15:25.558
( yells )
（大喊）

15:27.594 --> 15:28.561
( screams )
（尖叫声）

15:28.595 --> 15:30.397
WHAT ARE YOU DOING HERE?!
你在这里做什么？

15:30.430 --> 15:32.099
( teeth chattering )
（牙齿打颤）

15:32.132 --> 15:33.433
NO!... NO!
不！...不！

15:33.466 --> 15:36.236
WELL, ARE YOU TWO GOING
TO SAY SOMETHING OR...
好吧，你们两个去吗？
说些什么或...

15:36.269 --> 15:37.637
NO, STAY BACK!
不，退后！

15:37.670 --> 15:39.639
WHAT IS THE MATTER WITH YOU TWO?
你们两个怎么了？

15:39.672 --> 15:41.608
DON'T! DON'T HURT US!
不！不要伤害我们！

15:41.641 --> 15:44.011
( sobbing ):
IT WAS AN ACCIDENT.
（抽泣）：
这是一次意外。

15:44.044 --> 15:46.279
WHAT ARE YOU TWO TALKING ABOUT?
你们两个在谈论什么？

15:46.313 --> 15:47.714
( splat )
（啪）

15:48.748 --> 15:49.749
( screams )
（尖叫声）

15:49.782 --> 15:51.418
LOOK WHAT YOU'VE DONE TO ME!
看看你对我做了什么！

15:51.451 --> 15:53.486
WHEN I GET MY HANDS
ON YOU, I'LL...
当我得到我的手时
在你身上，我会...

15:53.520 --> 15:55.722
SpongeBob:
PLEASE, MR. SQUIDWARD GHOST.
海绵宝宝：
请，先生。章鱼哥幽灵。

15:55.755 --> 15:57.390
SPARE US
YOUR GHOSTLY ANGER!
饶恕我们
你的幽灵般的愤怒！

15:57.424 --> 15:58.758
( kissing )
（接吻）

15:58.791 --> 16:01.628
OH, YES,
MR. SQUIDWARD'S GHOST!
哦，是的，
先生。章鱼哥的幽灵！

16:01.661 --> 16:03.296
PLEASE
DON'T HAUNT US.
请
不要困扰我们。

16:03.330 --> 16:05.999
WE'LL DO ANYTHING
YOU WANT.
我们会做任何事
你想要的。

16:06.033 --> 16:07.267
JUST HAVE
MERCY ON US!
刚刚拥有
怜悯我们吧！

16:07.300 --> 16:08.768
( menacingly ):
ENOUGH.
（威胁性地）：
够了。

16:08.801 --> 16:10.137
LISTEN UP!
听着！

16:10.170 --> 16:12.739
SQUIDWARD'S
GHOST IS FEELING
章鱼哥
幽灵是感觉

16:12.772 --> 16:15.275
UNUSUALLY
GENEROUS TODAY.
不寻常
今天很慷慨。

16:15.308 --> 16:16.709
HE HATH DECIDED
他已经决定了

16:16.743 --> 16:19.746
TO SPARE YE
A HORRIBLE FATE.
为了饶恕你们
可怕的命运。

16:19.779 --> 16:21.748
( hissing )
（嘶嘶声）

16:21.781 --> 16:23.316
ALL YE MUST DO
你们必须做的一切

16:23.350 --> 16:25.418
IS TEND
TO MY EVERY WHIM
是趋势
满足我的每一个心血来潮

16:25.452 --> 16:28.688
AND TICKLE
MY FANCY ON DEMAND.
和痒痒
我的喜好随需应变。

16:28.721 --> 16:30.057
DOES THAT
INCLUDE...
是这样吗
包括...

16:30.090 --> 16:31.124
QUIET!
安静的！

16:31.158 --> 16:33.393
NOW, DO
AS YOU'RE TOLD
现在，做
正如您所知

16:33.426 --> 16:39.566
LEST YE INCUR THE WRATH
OF SQUIDWARD!
以免招致愤怒
章鱼哥！

16:39.599 --> 16:40.600
I THINK
THEY MAKE
我认为
他们制造

16:40.633 --> 16:41.734
A CREAM
FOR THAT NOW.
奶油
现在就为了这个。

16:43.470 --> 16:45.438
( panting and groaning )
（气喘吁吁、呻吟）

16:45.472 --> 16:46.439
HERE?
这里？

16:46.473 --> 16:47.607
TOO HOT.
太热了。

16:47.640 --> 16:50.677
( huffing and puffing )
（气喘吁吁）

16:50.710 --> 16:51.678
HERE?
这里？

16:51.711 --> 16:53.413
NO, TOO WET.
不，太湿了。

16:53.446 --> 16:54.414
KEEP GOING.
继续前进。

16:54.447 --> 16:55.748
KEEP GOING.
继续前进。

16:57.150 --> 16:58.185
HERE?
这里？

16:58.218 --> 16:59.486
TOO LOOSE, LAUTREC.
太宽松了，劳特雷克。

16:59.519 --> 17:00.553
( rim shot )
（边缘射击）

17:02.555 --> 17:05.358
TOO TIRED...
太累了...

17:06.693 --> 17:08.228
PERFECT.
完美的。

17:08.261 --> 17:11.298
HMM, I FEEL... NEEDY.
嗯，我觉得……有需要。

17:11.331 --> 17:14.301
SLAVES, FETCHETH ME
SOME NOURISHMENT.
奴隶们，来抓我吧
一些营养。

17:14.334 --> 17:17.237
ONLY THE FRESHEST,
O SPOOKY ONE.
只做最新鲜的，
哦，幽灵般的一个。

17:17.270 --> 17:20.340
A GRAPE FRESH FROM THE
VINE, YOUR GHOSTLINESS.
新鲜的葡萄
藤蔓，你的幽灵。

17:20.373 --> 17:23.143
MMM, MMM, MMM!
嗯，嗯，嗯！

17:23.176 --> 17:25.078
A BANANA PEELED
TO YOUR LIKING
剥皮的香蕉
根据您的喜好

17:25.112 --> 17:26.279
YOUR INCORPORIALNESS.
你的无形体。

17:26.313 --> 17:28.415
MMM...
嗯……

17:28.448 --> 17:29.282
( gulps )
（咽了口口水）

17:29.316 --> 17:30.283
ONE WATERMELON...
一个西瓜...

17:30.317 --> 17:31.351
D'OH!
天啊！

17:31.384 --> 17:33.286
FRESH FROM
THE MANURE FIELD
新鲜来自
粪肥场

17:33.320 --> 17:34.187
YOUR SPOOKINESS.
你的诡异。

17:35.455 --> 17:36.856
ART THOU NOT PLEASED?
您不高兴吗？

17:36.889 --> 17:39.259
( spitting, sputtering )
（吐痰、溅水）

17:39.292 --> 17:41.228
ENOUGH OF THAT!
够了！

17:41.261 --> 17:44.331
I WANT SOMETHING
ELSE TO EAT NOW.
我想要一些东西
现在就吃吧。

17:44.364 --> 17:47.167
SOMETHING THAT'S
VERY DIFFICULT TO FIND.
那是
很难找到。

17:47.200 --> 17:49.336
WHAT DO YOU
HUNGER FOR, MASTER?
你做什么
饥饿吗，主人？

17:49.369 --> 17:51.338
WHATEVER YOU WANT,
WE'LL FIND IT.
无论你想要什么，
我们会找到它。

17:51.371 --> 17:53.206
WE'LL FIND IT!
我们会找到它！

17:53.240 --> 17:55.642
CHERRY PIE.
樱桃派。

17:55.675 --> 17:56.776
WHERE'D
YOU GET THAT?
在哪里
你明白了吗？

17:56.809 --> 17:57.777
I FOUND IT.
我找到了。

17:57.810 --> 17:59.679
WELL, GO
FIND IT AGAIN!
好吧，去吧
再次找到它！

18:01.481 --> 18:04.384
SPONGEBOB,
GET OVER HERE.
海绵宝宝，
到这里来。

18:04.417 --> 18:06.253
NOW SPIN AROUND.
现在旋转。

18:06.286 --> 18:07.420
THAT'S BETTER.
这样更好。

18:07.454 --> 18:08.755
NOW JOG IN PLACE.
现在就地慢跑。

18:11.324 --> 18:12.292
SAY "FLANK STEAK."
说“侧腹牛排”。

18:12.325 --> 18:13.526
FLANK STEAK.
侧腹牛排。

18:13.560 --> 18:16.229
I THINK I'M BEGINNING
TO LIKE THIS.
我想我要开始了
喜欢这个。

18:16.263 --> 18:17.230
STOP.
停止。

18:17.264 --> 18:18.398
( feet squeal )
（脚尖叫）

18:18.431 --> 18:20.433
NOW PLAY ME
AN ELABORATE SONG
现在玩我
一首精心制作的歌曲

18:20.467 --> 18:21.801
WITH THIS!
有了这个！

18:21.834 --> 18:25.172
BUT... THIS IS JUST
A PIECE OF TISSUE PAPER.
但是...这只是
一张薄纸。

18:25.205 --> 18:26.606
OH, MY!
哦，天哪！

18:26.639 --> 18:29.576
ALWAYS HAVE TO HAVE IT
OUR WAY, DON'T WE?
永远必须拥有它
我们的方式，不是吗？

18:29.609 --> 18:30.810
OH, BOO-HOO.
噢，嘘。

18:32.512 --> 18:35.382
( tries to play song )
（尝试播放歌曲）

18:35.415 --> 18:37.617
I CAN'T DO IT!
我做不到！

18:37.650 --> 18:39.352
WELL, I HOPE
YOU DON'T HAVE
嗯，我希望
你没有

18:39.386 --> 18:40.620
ANY PLANS TONIGHT
今晚有什么计划吗

18:40.653 --> 18:43.256
BECAUSE YOU'RE NOT
ALLOWED TO LEAVE THAT SPOT
因为你不是
允许离开该地点

18:43.290 --> 18:45.258
TILL I HEAR A SONG.
直到我听到一首歌。

18:49.862 --> 18:53.733
( crickets chirping )
（蟋蟀鸣叫）

18:56.536 --> 18:58.738
( rooster crows )
（公鸡打鸣）

18:59.772 --> 19:01.174
Squidward:
WHAT'S THIS?
章鱼哥：
这是什么？

19:01.208 --> 19:03.243
NAPPING ON THE JOB?
在工作中打瞌睡？

19:03.276 --> 19:06.446
YOU'RE SUPPOSED TO BE
MAKING MUSIC FOR ME.
你应该是
为我创作音乐。

19:06.479 --> 19:08.781
AS PUNISHMENT
FOR THIS INSOLENCE
作为惩罚
对于这种无礼的行为

19:08.815 --> 19:11.384
SQUIDWARD'S GHOST
COMMANDETH YOU
章鱼哥的幽灵
命令你

19:11.418 --> 19:13.753
TO CLEAN OUT
HIS BACK ROOM.
清理
他的后屋。

19:13.786 --> 19:14.754
I FOUND IT.
我找到了。

19:14.787 --> 19:16.823
I'LL TAKE THAT.
我会接受的。

19:16.856 --> 19:18.425
YES, YOUR GHOSTLINESS.
是的，你的幽灵般的气质。

19:18.458 --> 19:19.426
( slurps )
（啜饮）

19:19.459 --> 19:20.460
THIS IS FUN.
这很有趣。

19:23.496 --> 19:25.298
PATRICK, ARE YOU READY FOR THIS?
帕特里克，你准备好了吗？

19:25.332 --> 19:26.333
Patrick:
YES.
帕特里克：
是的。

19:26.366 --> 19:27.467
OKAY, LET'S GO.
好吧，我们走吧。

19:27.500 --> 19:28.868
PATRICK, ARE YOU COMING?
帕特里克，你来吗？

19:28.901 --> 19:29.836
YES.
是的。

19:29.869 --> 19:31.304
PATRICK, IT'S THIS WAY.
帕特里克，这边。

19:31.338 --> 19:32.305
WHERE?
在哪里？

19:32.339 --> 19:33.473
HERE.
这里。

19:33.506 --> 19:34.507
OH! COMING!
哦！未来！

19:35.608 --> 19:37.477
HOW ARE WE
GOING TO CLEAN UP
我们怎么样
去清理

19:37.510 --> 19:38.511
ALL THIS MESS?
这一切都乱七八糟？

19:38.545 --> 19:39.812
IT'S EASY.
这很容易。

19:39.846 --> 19:41.848
JUST TEAR
THIS WALLPAPER OFF.
只是撕
此壁纸已关闭。

19:41.881 --> 19:43.283
( guffaws )
（大笑）

19:43.316 --> 19:45.485
OH, LOOK,
YOU MISSED SOME.
哦，看，
你错过了一些。

19:45.518 --> 19:46.286
OH, LET'S SEE.
哦，让我们看看。

19:46.319 --> 19:48.655
IT'S A COMIC BOOK,
AND LOOK AT THIS--
这是一本漫画书，
看看这个——

19:48.688 --> 19:51.258
IT'S THE ORIGIN
OF THE FLYING DUTCHMAN.
这就是起源
飞翔的荷兰人号。

19:51.291 --> 19:52.825
IT SAYS WHEN HE DIED
上面说他死的时候

19:52.859 --> 19:55.395
THEY USED HIS BODY
AS A WINDOW DISPLAY.
他们用了他的身体
作为橱窗展示。

19:55.428 --> 19:57.430
NOW HE HAUNTS
THE SEVEN SEAS
现在他出没
七大洋

19:57.464 --> 19:59.499
BECAUSE HE WAS
NEVER PUT TO REST.
因为他是
切勿休息。

19:59.532 --> 20:01.701
WELL, DON'T YOU
GET IT, PATRICK?
好吧，你不
明白了吗，帕特里克？

20:01.734 --> 20:03.370
WE'RE GOING
TO GO SHOPPING?
我们要去
去购物？

20:03.403 --> 20:04.437
NO! WE'RE GOING
不！我们要去

20:04.471 --> 20:06.339
TO PUT POOR OLD
SQUIDWARD TO REST.
把穷老
章鱼哥去休息了。

20:08.275 --> 20:10.377
OW! WHAT THE HECK WAS THAT?
噢！那到底是什么？

20:10.410 --> 20:11.478
INITIATION.
引发。

20:11.511 --> 20:12.579
( giggles )
（咯咯笑）

20:12.612 --> 20:14.514
THAT WAS PART ONE
OF YOUR CEREMONY.
这是第一部分
您的仪式。

20:14.547 --> 20:15.882
CEREMONY FOR WHAT?
仪式为了什么？

20:15.915 --> 20:18.385
WE'RE GOING
TO PUT YOU TO REST.
我们要去
让您安息。

20:18.418 --> 20:20.487
I DON'T WANT
TO BE PUT TO REST!
我不想要
安息吧！

20:20.520 --> 20:22.489
ALL I WANT ARE
THOSE CHORES DONE.
我想要的只是
那些杂务完成了。

20:22.522 --> 20:24.324
NOW, DID YOU CLEAN
THE BACK ROOM YET?
现在，你清洁了吗？
后面的房间还没到吗？

20:24.357 --> 20:25.325
YEAH.
是的。

20:25.358 --> 20:26.593
OH, REALLY?
哦真的吗？

20:26.626 --> 20:27.760
I'M GOING TO GO CHECK.
我要去检查一下。

20:28.961 --> 20:29.929
( screams )
（尖叫声）

20:29.962 --> 20:30.963
OKAY, GET IN.
好的，进去吧。

20:30.997 --> 20:31.964
ARE YOU CRAZY?
你疯了？

20:31.998 --> 20:33.400
I'M NOT GETTING IN.
我不进去。

20:33.433 --> 20:35.635
BUT YOU SAID WE COULD
PUT YOU TO REST.
但你说我们可以
让您安息。

20:35.668 --> 20:37.337
I DIDN'T SAY
ANYTHING LIKE THAT.
我没说
类似的事情。

20:37.370 --> 20:39.572
NOW, GET OUT
OF MY HOUSE!
现在，出去
我的房子！

20:39.606 --> 20:40.573
OKAY.
好的。

20:41.574 --> 20:42.775
( door closes )
（门关上）

20:43.810 --> 20:44.877
( sighs )
（叹气）

20:44.911 --> 20:46.379
NOW WHAT?
现在怎么办？

20:47.580 --> 20:49.282
I WROTE
"HERE LIES SQUIDWARD.
我写的
“这里躺着章鱼哥。

20:49.316 --> 20:51.351
YOU MAY NOT
REMEMBER HIM, BUT..."
你可能不会
记住他，但是……”

20:51.384 --> 20:52.452
( screams )
（尖叫声）

20:52.485 --> 20:53.620
OH, HI, SQUIDWARD.
哦，嗨，章鱼哥。

20:53.653 --> 20:55.288
DOES THIS LOOK
DEEP ENOUGH?
这看起来像吗
够深吗？

20:55.322 --> 20:57.357
SPONGEBOB,
CUT THAT OUT!
海绵宝宝，
别再这样了！

20:57.390 --> 20:58.958
SpongeBob:
OH, LOOK, THE MOURNERS.
海绵宝宝：
哦，看，哀悼者们。

20:58.991 --> 21:00.660
OH, SQUIDWARD, WE ALL CAME
哦，章鱼哥，我们都来了

21:00.693 --> 21:02.662
AS SOON AS WE WERE
SURE YOU WERE DEAD.
我们刚到的时候
你肯定死了。

21:02.695 --> 21:05.665
SPONGEBOB, ARE YOU
TRYING TO PUT ME
海绵宝宝，是你吗
试图让我

21:05.698 --> 21:07.066
IN THE NUTHOUSE?
在疯人院里？

21:07.099 --> 21:08.701
NO, JUST
INTO THIS HOLE.
不，只是
进入这个洞。

21:08.735 --> 21:10.737
( groaning )
（呻吟）

21:10.770 --> 21:11.904
( sighs )
（叹气）

21:11.938 --> 21:15.007
SPONGEBOB, I HAVE
A CONFESSION TO MAKE.
海绵宝宝，我有
一个坦白。

21:15.041 --> 21:16.008
( squeals )
（尖叫声）

21:16.042 --> 21:17.577
YOU'RE BALD?
你秃头了？

21:17.610 --> 21:19.078
NO, I'M NOT BALD!
不，我没有秃头！

21:19.111 --> 21:20.880
I'M ALIVE!
我还活着！

21:20.913 --> 21:22.615
NOW, GET RID
OF THAT TOMBSTONE
现在，摆脱吧
那个墓碑的

21:22.649 --> 21:24.884
AND TELL ALL YOUR
FRIENDS TO GO HOME.
并告诉你所有的
朋友们回家吧。

21:24.917 --> 21:26.353
GO HOME.
回家吧。

21:26.386 --> 21:28.588
( all grumbling )
（都在发牢骚）

21:29.889 --> 21:30.890
BUT I...
但我...

21:30.923 --> 21:31.891
MASTER...
掌握...

21:31.924 --> 21:33.560
I'M NOT YOUR MASTER.
我不是你的主人。

21:33.593 --> 21:35.462
I'M YOUR NEIGHBOR.
我是你的邻居。

21:35.495 --> 21:36.796
NOW, DO ME A FAVOR
现在，帮我一个忙

21:36.829 --> 21:38.998
AND STOP DOING ME FAVORS!
别再帮我忙了！

21:40.733 --> 21:42.735
AS YOU WISH, MASTER.
如您所愿，主人。

21:42.769 --> 21:44.571
D'OH!
天啊！

21:44.604 --> 21:46.939
BOY, HE REALLY
HAD US FOOLED.
男孩，他真的
让我们被愚弄了。

21:46.973 --> 21:49.376
NO, PATRICK,
HE'S THE FOOL.
不，帕特里克，
他是个傻瓜。

21:49.409 --> 21:51.077
HE'S A GHOST IN DENIAL.
他是一个否认的幽灵。

21:51.110 --> 21:53.480
HE NEEDS US NOW MORE THAN EVER.
他现在比以往任何时候都更需要我们。

21:53.513 --> 21:54.447
YOU'RE RIGHT.
你说得对。

21:54.481 --> 21:57.650
HE REALLY NEEDS TO GET
UP TO THE GREAT BEYOND.
他真的需要得到
直至超越。

21:57.684 --> 21:58.718
PATRICK,
SAY THAT AGAIN.
帕特里克，
再说一遍。

21:58.751 --> 21:59.719
THAT AGAIN.
又是这样。

21:59.752 --> 22:00.787
NO, THE OTHER THING.
不，是另一件事。

22:00.820 --> 22:01.888
NO, THE OTHER THING.
不，是另一件事。

22:01.921 --> 22:03.590
NO, WHAT YOU SAID
BEFORE WHEN...
不，你说的
之前，当...

22:03.623 --> 22:05.558
NO, WHAT YOU SAID
BEFORE WHEN...
不，你说的
之前，当...

22:05.592 --> 22:06.693
NEVER MIND!
没关系！

22:06.726 --> 22:07.860
I'VE GOT AN IDEA.
我有一个主意。

22:07.894 --> 22:10.463
NEVER MIND,
I'VE GOT AN IDEA.
没关系，
我有一个主意。

22:10.497 --> 22:13.433
( somebody exhaling )
（某人呼气）

22:13.466 --> 22:15.502
SpongeBob
( whispering ):
I CAN'T REACH HIM.
海绵宝宝
（窃窃私语）：
我联系不到他。

22:15.535 --> 22:16.469
Patrick:
BLOW HARDER.
帕特里克：
吹得更用力。

22:16.503 --> 22:20.840
( SpongeBob
exhaling again )
（海绵宝宝
再次呼气）

22:20.873 --> 22:23.410
Patrick:
THERE HE GOES!
帕特里克：
他来了！

22:23.443 --> 22:24.411
( sniffles )
（抽鼻子）

22:24.444 --> 22:25.812
ISN'T HE BEAUTIFUL?
他不是很漂亮吗？

22:25.845 --> 22:27.914
HOW HIGH'S
HE GOING TO GO?
有多高
他要去吗？

22:27.947 --> 22:31.651
ALL THE WAY, PATRICK,
UP TO THE GREAT BEYOND.
一路走好，帕特里克，
直至超越。

22:31.684 --> 22:32.652
( sniffles )
（抽鼻子）

22:32.685 --> 22:34.654
GOOD-BYE, FRIEND.
再见，朋友。

22:34.687 --> 22:36.556
HAPPY TRAILS!
快乐的足迹！

22:36.589 --> 22:40.527
( yelling angrily )
（愤怒地大喊）

22:40.560 --> 22:43.696
YOU'RE WELCOME!
YOU'RE WELCOME!
不客气！
不客气！

22:46.699 --> 22:48.167
HE'S ON
THE OTHER SIDE NOW.
他来了
现在是另一边。

22:48.200 --> 22:49.602
YEAH.
是的。

22:49.636 --> 22:52.071
HE'S IN
A BETTER PLACE.
他来了
一个更好的地方。

22:52.104 --> 22:55.041
( sighing )
（叹气）

22:58.177 --> 23:01.748
